 to disturbances, and hunt you down. If you are seen, you are likely dead.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517930/extras/6b32a6b3e9395a37744b96371e172733.avif?t=1780623014\" width=780 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517930/extras/906fa62867c671c81da1b2c134d0bcf2.poster.avif?t=1780623014\" width=778 height=334 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517930/extras/906fa62867c671c81da1b2c134d0bcf2.webm?t=1780623014\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517930/extras/906fa62867c671c81da1b2c134d0bcf2.mp4?t=1780623014\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your path to vengeance is paved with puzzles and peril.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Traverse a Handcrafted Nightmare:</strong> Journey from the gore-slicked Eye-Gouger<strong> </strong>Tunnels<strong> </strong>and the Darkened Light Temple<strong> </strong>to the imposing shadows of the King's<strong> </strong>Castle. Every biome demands new strategies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weaponize the World:</strong> Your blade is lethal, but the environment is your playground. Supplement your combat skills by luring enemies into ancient traps or manipulating the architecture to crush those who stand in your way.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3517930/extras/7b20da4111ac90681f9cbbdd4b5eee99.avif?t=1780623014\" width=780 height=80 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2